# Build context pruning for the reproducible production image (Dockerfile).
# Goal: a clean checkout is the only build input. Everything required for
# `dotnet restore/publish Tesserafin.Server` is retained; everything else,
# and anything that would make the build non-deterministic, is excluded.

# --- Version control ---
.git
.gitattributes
.gitignore

# --- Build outputs: MUST be excluded (reproducibility + size) ---
**/bin
**/obj
**/out
artifacts/
**/TestResults

# --- Container definition & its tooling (not a build input) ---
.dockerignore
Dockerfile
Dockerfile.arm
Dockerfile.arm64
Dockerfile.ci
docker-bake.hcl
docker/

# --- CI harnesses (hosted + local); not needed to publish the server ---
.github/
ci/
.devcontainer/

# --- IDE / editor cruft ---
.vs/
.vscode/
.idea/
*.user
*.suo
*.DotSettings.user

# --- Docs, packaging templates, meta (not build inputs) ---
CONTRIBUTORS.md
CONTRIBUTING.md
README.md
SECURITY.md
docs/
deployment/

# --- Local data / secrets (never ship) ---
.env
*.env
*.pfx
*.key
